#: app/actividades/base.py:62
msgid "Las puntuaciones describen lo ocurrido en el simulador. No equivalen a competencia en el lugar real ni son un diagnóstico."
msgstr "Scores describe what happened in the simulator. They are not the same as skill in the real place, and they are not a diagnosis."

